  'draft', 'core',
  'A 61-year-old man with Gram-negative sepsis secondary to pyelonephritis is started on gentamicin using an extended-interval (once-daily) regimen alongside a beta-lactam. His estimated creatinine clearance is 75 mL/min. The team plans to check a level to guide the next dose.',
